OL,3,GNEWSAWestminster's time is coming to an
OL,4,Aend, Welsh, Scottish, Northern Irish
OL,5,Aleaders say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,8,Fand Northern Ireland have declared that
OL,9,F"Westminster's time is coming to an
OL,10,Fend", and that the UK government should
OL,11,F"prepare" for constitutional change.
OL,13,FThe nationalist leaders from Plaid
OL,14,FCymru, Sinn Fein and the SNP - who want
OL,15,Ftheir countries to leave the United
OL,16,FKingdom - signed an agreement on Monday
OL,17,Fwhich said no Westminster government
OL,18,Fhad the right to "block democracy".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
